gate: S84 gates on the official law; G1 K = official FGT counters bitwise (all C, main, flipped and unflipped twins, every step); G2 C=0 table = replay84 every main step, C=0 twin table = FGT twin every step, C=0 twin D_s(T, Q) = FGT bitwise; G3 M aggregates = recount from M.list (end of life, every twin read point, every U point); G4 unflipped twin table and M.list = main at every read point; G5 R1 independent form every step of every branch, at s exactly one branch keeps when p_s != 1/2 (C>=1: tail is s only there), none and M.list unchanged when p_s = 1/2; G6 independent reference (own counters, own R1, M_ref = last(hist, C)) = M.list on every main and twin step incl. s, finite C in (1, 2): length <= C, unchanged when R1 does not keep, head-out + order + tail when full, main evictions > 0 at C=1 and C=2; G9 p_K = FGT table, C=0 dG_O1 == 0.0, key class m>0 = any in M.list, |dG_O1 - (direct + rate-only)| < 1e-12 at every U point; G7 C=inf group lines and S88 E1-E3 lines = s88 l2l.out verbatim (16 lines); G8 FGT D on T / Q quartiles = S86 bisim.out / S87 contents.out
capacities C = 0, 1, 2, inf (D1 oldest-out). seen 48 lives; no capacity is selected from these results.
